ShowStoreWarrantyStr.description:
There are three possible options: 1) 'none' hides a StoreWarrantyMessage on the first step of the Request Wizard;
            2) 'show' shows a StoreWarrantyMessage on the first step of the Request Wizard;
            3) 'stop' shows a StoreWarrantyMessage without a possibility to move to the next step.
